  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "多すぎる時は、頭の中で全部が同じ大きさに見えるよね。",
      "translatedText": "When there is too much, everything in your head starts looking the same size.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "だから、今は並べ直すだけでいい。解決は、その次。",
      "translatedText": "So for now, just lay things out again. Solving comes after that.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Sort it with me.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_002_sort",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "player",
              "stat": "stress",
              "amount": -0.35,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "engagement",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Just sit with me.",
          "nextId": "player_stressed_002_sit",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "player",
              "stat": "rest",
              "amount": 0.25,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "reassurance",
              "amount": 0.2,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_002_sort",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "よし、分類しよう。解決じゃなくて、まず棚を作るだけ。",
      "translatedText": "Okay, let us sort it. Not solve it, just make shelves first.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_002_sit",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "分かった。今は分析しないで、少し隣に置いておこう。",
      "translatedText": "Understood. For now, we will not analyze it. We will place it beside us for a little.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_002_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "紙でもメモでもいいから、外に出すと少し弱くなる。",
      "translatedText": "Paper or a note is enough. Once it is outside your head, it gets a little weaker.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_stressed_002_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_stressed_002_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私は横で分類係をする。大きい、急ぎ、今じゃない。そういうふうに。",
      "translatedText": "I will be the sorting person beside you: big, urgent, not now. Like that.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
    }
  ]
